    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24479" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interstĭtĭum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				space between</i>, <i>interstice</i>, <i>interval</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Of place,
				<i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 6</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 8, § 837</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Amm. 20, 3, 10</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Of time, <i>an interval</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quantum interstitii dies habet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 6, § 601</span></i>
			.— <i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart.
					Cap. 6, § 600</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
